  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\nreplacement windows, by reason of their incongruous design and materials,\r\nwould undermine the established character and appearance of the locally listed\r\nterrace at 7–17 London Road and would fail to preserve or enhance the character\r\nand appearance of the Sudbury Hill Conservation Area. This would result in harm\r\nto both the host property and the wider area.&amp;nbsp; Furthermore, insufficient\r\ninformation has been submitted to enable a comprehensive assessment of the\r\nproposal.&amp;nbsp; The proposal is therefore contrary to the high-quality design\r\nobjectives of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024); Policies D3, (D1,\r\nD11, D12) and HC1 of the London Plan (2021); Policies GR1 and HE1 of the Harrow\r\nLocal Plan (2021–2041); the adopted Supplementary Planning Document:\r\nResidential Design Guide (2010); and the adopted Sudbury Hill Estate\r\nConservation Area Appraisal and Management Strategy (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
